  "note": "'on day one' and 'personally' are added: [15:24] 'He says he walked in and gave the footage to the Orem Police Department... they said, you know, we were overwhelmed on that day one'. He told 'us' (host's team).",
  "fix": {
   "claim": "A second rooftop witness told the host's team he walked in and gave his footage to the Orem Police Department, which said it was overwhelmed on day one, and that the feds did not reach out to him until September 15, after Governor Cox said the investigation was over and they had the guy.",
   "label": "Second Rooftop Witness Gave Footage to Orem Police Department; Feds Did Not Contact Him Until September 15"
  }
 },
