  "fix": {
   "claim": "The host says Xaviaer DuRousseau made a video in which he says Charlie Kirk used the phrase 'moral blackmail' at the Hamptons weekend, in a workshop setting like a debate club; in the clip DuRousseau says Charlie called it moral blackmail to say that criticizing a politician empowers a terrorist organization.",
   "label": "DuRousseau Says Charlie Kirk Used the Phrase 'Moral Blackmail' in a Workshop Setting"
  }
 },
